                 L A T E N T  -  8k intro

  title ....... Una Corda
  type ........ 8k intro, WebGL2, single HTML file (8,178 bytes)
  code ........ Claude Opus 5.5
  music ....... Claude Opus 5.5 - nocturne in D-flat major, original
  harness ..... Claude Code
  runs on ..... Edge / Chrome on Windows, double-click intro.html

  An original nocturne for a modelled concert grand, filmed from
  inside the piano. Every note is a draw call that synthesises one
  struck string (inharmonic partials, two detuned unisons, hammer,
  dampers, pedal); the same note list moves the hammers, lifts the
  dampers, presses the keys and lights the strings you see.

  credits: piano physics after Fletcher & Rossing and Weinreich,
  Railsback stretch tuning, FDN reverb after Jot & Chaigne,
  Kajiya-Kay shading, ACES fit by K. Narkowicz, hash by D. Hoskins.
